<title>HONG KONG: Bear Stearns sets warrants on China Res.</title>
<headline>Bear Stearns sets warrants on China Res.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bear Stearns Companies Inc said on Friday it intended to issue 175 million American-style call warrants on shares of China Resources Enterprise Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$20.02    PREMIUM	 30.75 pct</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.37765  GEARING	 4.82X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	02.JAN.98   MIN EXER LOT  20,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  HK$18.20    LISTING DATE  22.01.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
